OL,3,AFour reported dead and suspect killed
OL,4,Ain shooting at Oregon elementary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FFour people have reportedly been killed
OL,7,Fin a shooting at an elementary school
OL,8,Fin the US state of Oregon, local police
OL,9,Fsay
OL,11,FThree of the victims were children and
OL,12,Fone was an adult, the BBC's US partner
OL,13,FCBS News reports. Officials say the
OL,14,Fshooter is dead
OL,16,FPolice in Bend, Oregon responded to
OL,17,FSilver Rail Elementary School Thursday
OL,18,Fafternoon on reports that an unknown
OL,19,Fsuspect had fired at a car before
OL,20,Fentering the school
OL,23,APub: 16-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
