OL,3,AFour reported dead and suspect killed
OL,4,Ain shooting at Oregon elementary school
OL,5,
OL,6,FImages show bullet holes in a red truck
OL,7,Foutside of the campus
OL,9,FThe suspect was a teenager, CBS
OL,10,Freports, and was reportedly shot dead
OL,11,Fby a bystander
OL,13,FOfficials have not provided any details
OL,14,Fon the identities of the shooter or the
OL,15,Fvictims
OL,17,F"We are stunned and heartbroken by this
OL,18,Fsenseless tragedy," school
OL,19,Fsuperintendent Steven Cook said
